<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle market at standstill -USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle market at standstill -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area early Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>The last established price was 64.00 on Thursday. Today's packer bids are 64.00 with asking prices 66.00-68.00. Note all cattle prices based on net weights FOB the feedlot after a 4 percent shrink.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
